#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-plugin.php:43
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavenia"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-plugin.php:129
msgid ""
"WooCommerce SK/CZ Functions requires the WooCommerce plugin to be active."
msgstr "WooCommerce SK/CZ Functions vyžaduje aktívny plugin WooCommerce."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:32
#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:82
msgid "WooCommerce SK/CZ"
msgstr "WooCommerce SK/CZ"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:87
msgid "Checkout button text"
msgstr "Text tlačidla v pokladni"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:88
msgid ""
"Leave the predefined text unchanged to use the translated default for the "
"current site language. Clear the field to return to the default after saving "
"custom text."
msgstr ""
"Nechajte predvyplnený text bez zmeny, aby sa použil preložený predvolený "
"text pre aktuálny jazyk stránky. Vymažte pole, ak sa po uložení vlastného "
"textu chcete vrátiť k predvolenému textu."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-settings.php:78
msgid "Objednať s povinnosťou platby"
msgstr "Objednať s povinnosťou platby"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:87
msgid "Enable company checkout fields"
msgstr "Povoliť firemné polia v pokladni"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:88
msgid "Adds company purchase checkbox and business fields at checkout."
msgstr "Pridá checkbox nákupu na firmu a firemné polia v pokladni."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:96
msgid "Enable GDPR checkbox in checkout"
msgstr "Povoliť GDPR checkbox v pokladni"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:105
msgid "Enable child category row on archives"
msgstr "Povoliť riadok podradených kategórií v archívoch"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:106
msgid "Displays child categories above products on category archive pages."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí podradené kategórie nad produktmi na stránkach archívov kategórií."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:114
msgid "Hide paid shipping when free shipping exists"
msgstr "Skryť platené možnosti  dopravy, keď je k dispozícii doprava zdarma"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:115
msgid "Shows only free shipping rates when free shipping is available."
msgstr ""
"Schová platené možnosti dopravy a zobrazí iba dopravu zdarma, keď je doprava "
"zdarma dostupná."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:123
msgid "Hide Additional Information tab on products"
msgstr "Skryť kartu Ďalšie informácie na produktoch"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:124
msgid "Removes the Additional Information tab from single product pages."
msgstr "Odstráni kartu Ďalšie informácie na stránkach jednotlivých produktov."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:133
msgid ""
"When enabled, show the hidden Additional Information content directly in the "
"long product description instead of hiding it completely."
msgstr ""
"Ak je povolené, skrytý obsah karty Ďalšie informácie sa zobrazí priamo v "
"dlhom popise produktu namiesto úplného skrytia."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:141
msgid "Enable COD fee"
msgstr "Povoliť poplatok za dobierku"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:142
msgid ""
"Adds an extra fee when the customer selects the Cash on Delivery payment "
"gateway."
msgstr "Pridá extra poplatok, keď zákazník zvolí platobnú bránu Dobierka."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:150
msgid "Default COD fee amount"
msgstr "Predvolená výška poplatku za dobierku"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:151
msgid ""
"Used when no configured cart-total band matches. Based on cart total after "
"shipping, tax, and coupons."
msgstr ""
"Použije sa, keď sa nezhoduje žiadne nakonfigurované pásmo sumy košíka. "
"Vychádza z celkovej sumy košíka po doprave, dani a kupónoch."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:160
msgid "COD fee label"
msgstr "Názov poplatku za dobierku"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:161
msgid "Frontend fee label. Leave empty to use the default plugin label."
msgstr ""
"Názov poplatku zobrazený zákazníkovi. Nechajte prázdne pre predvolený názov "
"pluginu."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:227
msgid "Not ready yet."
msgstr "Zatiaľ nie je pripravené."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:240
msgid ""
"Classic checkout only: Adds a required privacy-policy consent checkbox at "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"Len pre klasický checkout: Pridá povinný checkbox súhlasu so zásadami "
"ochrany osobných údajov v pokladni."

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/class-wc-settings-tab.php:241
msgid ""
"In block checkout, the GDPR checkbox is combined with the terms-and-"
"conditions checkbox."
msgstr "V blokovej pokladni je GDPR checkbox spojený s VOP checkboxom v jednom"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/features/class-cod-fee.php:162
msgid "Cash on delivery fee"
msgstr "Poplatok za dobierku"

#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/features/class-company-checkout-fields.php:60
#: woocommerce-sk-cz-functions/includes/features/class-company-checkout-fields.php:145
